Root cause:
The bug was caused by the incorrect handling of quantifiers in the Z3 solver implementation. Specifically, quantifiers were mistakenly treated as application terms, which led to incorrect behavior when checking the type of formulas. The patch corrects this by explicitly checking for quantifier AST types and ensuring that quantifiers are not processed as application terms, thus preventing erroneous assumptions about their structure and properties.
